This project was developed as a substantial rewrite and extension
of an earlier fork of binsentsu/home-assistant-solaredge-modbus
available at https://github.com/WillCodeForCats/home-assistant-solaredge-modbus.

Significant development beyond both previous works includes multi-device
and multi-inverter support, Synergy support, meter and battery
integration, expanded register coverage, with numerous operational
improvements developed through direct testing with real SolarEdge
hardware, Home Assistant development, and user feedback and contributors
across multiple firmware versions over a period of 4+ years.

The device detection logic, and operational edge case handling
documented in this project represent original research conducted
with real SolarEdge hardware.
